window.renderChancayBook=(t,href)=>`<article class="chancay-book"><img src="assets/chancay-book/cover.jpg" alt="从钱凯到上海 · 钱凯港开港一周年纪念册封面" fetchpriority="high"><section class="cb-copy"><h2>从钱凯到上海，把不凡时光装订成册。</h2><p>钱凯港开港一周年纪念册设计。以影像、时间与多语言编排，记录港口的建设、运营与共同成长。</p></section><img src="assets/chancay-book/contents.jpg" alt="纪念册目录与章节结构" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><section class="cb-copy"><h2>红色封面，蓝色叙事。</h2><p>以红色建立纪念感，以海洋蓝贯穿内页；用统一的网格与章节系统，组织中文、西班牙文和英文内容。</p></section><img src="assets/chancay-book/1.jpg" alt="章节扉页与三语编排" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div class="cb-grid"><img src="assets/chancay-book/2.jpg" alt="钱凯港纪念册 · 跨页设计 2" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><img src="assets/chancay-book/3.jpg" alt="钱凯港纪念册 · 跨页设计 3" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><img src="assets/chancay-book/4.jpg" alt="钱凯港纪念册 · 跨页设计 4" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><img src="assets/chancay-book/5.jpg" alt="钱凯港纪念册 · 跨页设计 5" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div><section class="cb-copy"><h2>让影像展开，让信息有序。</h2><p>跨页大图与留白交替呈现，连接开港现场、建设历程与港口日常。</p></section><div class="cb-grid"><img src="assets/chancay-book/6.jpg" alt="钱凯港纪念册 · 跨页设计 6" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><img src="assets/chancay-book/7.jpg" alt="钱凯港纪念册 · 跨页设计 7" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><img src="assets/chancay-book/8.jpg" alt="钱凯港纪念册 · 跨页设计 8" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><img src="assets/chancay-book/9.jpg" alt="钱凯港纪念册 · 跨页设计 9" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><img src="assets/chancay-book/10.jpg" alt="钱凯港纪念册 · 跨页设计 10" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><img src="assets/chancay-book/12.jpg" alt="钱凯港纪念册 · 跨页设计 12" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div><section class="cb-copy"><h2>一条航线，一年的足迹。</h2><p>用航线地图、运营数据与时间轴，将跨洋连接与周年成果转化为清晰的阅读线索。</p></section><img src="assets/chancay-book/11.jpg" alt="亚洲与拉丁美洲航线地图跨页" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div class="cb-grid"><img src="assets/chancay-book/13.jpg" alt="钱凯港纪念册 · 跨页设计 13" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><img src="assets/chancay-book/14.jpg" alt="钱凯港纪念册 · 跨页设计 14" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><img src="assets/chancay-book/15.jpg" alt="钱凯港纪念册 · 跨页设计 15" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><img src="assets/chancay-book/16.jpg" alt="钱凯港纪念册 · 跨页设计 16" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div><section class="cb-copy"><h2>港口之外，是人与自然。</h2><p>以环境、社会与治理为线索，在纪实影像中呈现港口与社区的连接。</p></section><div class="cb-esg"><img src="assets/chancay-book/18.jpg" alt="纪念册 ESG 跨页 18" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><img src="assets/chancay-book/19.jpg" alt="纪念册 ESG 跨页 19" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><img src="assets/chancay-book/20.jpg" alt="纪念册 ESG 跨页 20" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div><img src="assets/chancay-book/22.jpg" alt="社区文化与在地连接" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></article>`;